{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorMarkovModel"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.markov_rossoJones_of_middle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.markov_rossoJones_of_middle","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L225-L240","doc":"**Rosso–Jones for every Markov trace with `z_D`, conditional on `MiddleWeightTraces`.**\nFor any algebra with a Hecke family `(N, q − q⁻¹, 1)`, `n ≤ N`, and any normalised, cyclic\nMarkov trace `t` with `z = z_D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.rossoJones_of_middle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.rossoJones_of_middle","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L200-L223","doc":"**Rosso–Jones on `V^{⊗(n+1)}`, conditional on `MiddleWeightTraces`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.MiddleWeightTraces","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.MiddleWeightTraces","kind":"def","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L193-L198","doc":"**The named hypothesis.** On every non-extremal weight space of `V^{⊗(n+1)}`, the trace\nof `γ^p` is `q^{p(n+2) − 2p} − q^{pn − 2p}`, i.e. `q^{p(r−1)} − q^{p(r−3)}` (`r = n + 1`),\nstated with the factor `q^{2p}` cleared. Verified for `r ≤ 5` and `gcd(r, p) = 1` by the\nprobe; false when `gcd(r, p) > 1`. Not proved here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.T_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.T_top","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L182-L189","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.T_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.T_zero","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L173-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_eq_top_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_eq_top_iff","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L163-L171","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.ones_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L150-L161","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.gam_pow_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.gam_pow_const","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesGeneral.lean#L141-L148","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJ